---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Aegis Green • Real-Time Energy Telemetry & EFRAG VS Standards | Aegis"
  description="Measure real server hardware energy consumption (RAPL Watts, Joules) and automate CSRD & EFRAG VS compliance reports in one click."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Hero Section Module 3 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 pt-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>🌿 AEGIS GREEN • REAL-TIME ENERGY TELEMETRY &amp; ESG COMPLIANCE</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Measure real server power consumption and automate ESG reporting in one click.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        The first energy governance engine capturing electricity consumption at the hardware layer (Watts, Joules) and converting infrastructure metrics into standardized <strong>EFRAG VS</strong> and <strong>RGESN</strong> compliance indicators — <strong>without spending months on manual spreadsheets.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/get-started/" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-lg">
          🧪 Run Web Eco-Design Audit (Free)
        </a>
        <a href="#scaphandre-specs" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-sm border border-slate-700">
          📚 Scaphandre RAPL Specs
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Metaphor & Comparison Table -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 backdrop-blur-xl space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-2 font-mono">💡 THE SMART ELECTRIC METER FOR YOUR CLOUD</h2>
        <blockquote class="text-slate-200 text-base italic border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-4 py-1">
          Until now, calculating the carbon footprint of IT infrastructure was guesswork: teams multiplied computer counts by vague statistical averages. <strong>Aegis Green acts like a high-precision smart power meter plugged directly into your server processors</strong>. It measures exact Joules and Watts drawn by each service, then automatically outputs your audit-ready ESG report meeting bank and enterprise buyer mandates.
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparative Table -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs font-mono">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400">
              <th class="p-4">ESG Issue &amp; Compliance Requirement</th>
              <th class="p-4">Legacy Carbon Accounting (Spreadsheets / Theoretical SaaS)</th>
              <th class="p-4">With Aegis Green (Physical Hardware Telemetry)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Data Accuracy</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Theoretical spend ratios ("$1 spent = X kg CO2") prone to greenwashing disputes.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">Direct physical measurement in Watts &amp; Joules via RAPL registers and eBPF probes.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">Team Overhead</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-400">Dozens of engineering hours wasted collecting vendor invoices and filling tables.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-amber-300 font-bold">100% Automated: Continuous background polling with zero manual intervention.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-white">European EFRAG VS Alignment</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Complex, labor-intensive disclosures difficult to defend during independent audit.</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-bold">1-click generation of the E3 Environmental (Digital Sobriety) section compliant with EFRAG standards.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillars Architecture -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center">⚙️ Three Pillars of Aegis Green Innovation</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-2">1. LOW-LEVEL HARDWARE POLLING</div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Direct interrogation of <strong>RAPL registers (CPU/DRAM)</strong> and Linux eBPF probes via Rust daemon (&lt; 15 MB RAM).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-2">2. EFRAG VS &amp; RGESN ENGINE</div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Conversion of raw Watts into gCO2e (ADEME / Boavizta dataset) and automated compliance verification for software eco-design.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-2">3. CARBON-AWARE SCHEDULING</div>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Direct integration with grid carbon intensity APIs (e.g. EcoWatt) to dynamically shift compute-intensive jobs during green grid windows.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tech Specs Snippet -->
    <div id="scaphandre-specs" class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="text-slate-400 mb-3">// docker-compose.aegis-green-telemetry.yml</div>
      <pre is:raw class="text-amber-300 overflow-x-auto">
version: '3.8'
services:
  aegis-scaphandre-agent:
    image: hubblo/scaphandre:latest
    container_name: aegis_green_scaphandre
    volumes:
      - /proc:/proc
      - /sys/class/powercap:/sys/class/powercap
    deploy:
      resources:
        limits:
          memory: 15M # Certified ultra-frugal RAM footprint
      </pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <div class="text-center bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to measure real hardware energy and certify VS compliance?</h3>
      <a href="/get-started/" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm shadow-xl">
        🌿 Run eco-design audit
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
